From 68bf68d1423d418bc0a210a9f4fb7ce146d94c2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaoyuping <yaoyuping@hygon.cn>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 04:01:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/24] step4 DSA: fuse spec summaries, round q in norm_rope,
 cache decode rows meta per step

- fused spec summary/pending update kernel
- cache indexer param casts; pass raw bf16 weights with in-kernel weight_scale
- round index q to e4m3 in the norm_rope store (bit-identical) and skip the
  separate rounding pass in all scoring paths (q_prerounded)
- share decode_rows_meta across DSA layers within one forward step

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 model_executor/layers/step4_dsa.py         | 268 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 model_executor/layers/step4_dsa_kernels.py | 101 +++++---
 2 files changed, 327 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

